@startuml
title Code hien tai - USB joystick analog dieu khien gimbal

left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

legend top
  |= Mau |= Y nghia |
  |<#D5E8D4>| Giong PR: cuoi cung gui RC_CHANNELS cho Codev R3 |
  |<#DAE8FC>| Rieng code hien tai: giu gia tri analog ty le |
endlegend

actor Operator
component "USB joystick\nDR-1000" as USB #DAE8FC
component "Joystick::_loadSettings()\n_applyHardcodedProfile()" as Profile #DAE8FC
component "Joystick::_handleAxis()\n_adjustRange()" as Axis #DAE8FC
component "Signal\ngimbalAxisControl(pitch, yaw)" as Signal #DAE8FC
component "QGCCameraManager\n_gimbalAxisControl()" as Manager
component "Current camera\ngimbalAxisRateControl()" as Camera
component "CodevCameraControl\ngimbalAxisRateControl()" as Codev #D5E8D4
component "_sendR3RcChannels()" as SendRC #D5E8D4
component "Gimbal manager\npitch/yaw rate" as Generic
cloud "Vehicle link" as Link
component "R3 camera/gimbal" as R3 #D5E8D4

Operator --> USB : Di chuyen pitch/yaw
USB --> Profile : Ten thiet bi + raw axes
Profile --> Axis : axis 0 = pitch\naxis 3 = yaw\ndeadband = 2000
Axis --> Axis : Chuan hoa tung truc\n-1.0 .. 0 .. +1.0
Axis --> Signal : Gia tri analog lien tuc
Signal --> Manager : Qt signal/slot
Manager --> Camera : Goi virtual API cua camera hien tai

Camera --> Codev : Neu la Codev camera
Codev --> Codev : Analog -> PWM\n1000 .. 1500 .. 2000
Codev --> SendRC : CH9 pitch, CH10 yaw
SendRC --> Link : MAVLink RC_CHANNELS
Link --> R3 : Toc do theo do lech can

Camera --> Generic : Camera khac\npitch/yaw rate

note bottom of Axis
  Gimbal duoc xu ly doc lap voi checkbox joystickEnabled.
  Khi can ve tam, chi gui mot lan (0, 0) de stop.
end note

note bottom of Profile
  Profile DR-1000 la gimbal-only.
  Khong gui MANUAL_CONTROL dieu khien may bay.
end note

note bottom of Codev
  Do lech can lon hon => PWM xa 1500 hon
  => gimbal quay nhanh hon.
end note

@enduml
